"""zembed: sets up Zed for an embedded firmware project.

    zembed init [PROJECT]     write .zed/debug.json, tasks.json, settings.json
    zembed doctor [PROJECT]   check the project and the debugging tools

Works for PlatformIO projects (ESP32 through gdb-openocd, other boards
through probe-rs) and embedded Rust projects (probe-rs). Only uses Python's
standard library: PlatformIO always brings a Python 3.
"""

